uperf-linux-rev (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial capability-driven Rust implementation.
  * Ship mutually exclusive headless and self-contained GUI editions.
  * Both editions include the SM8550 profile, version 2 schemas, system
    service, D-Bus policy, PolicyKit actions, CLI, and probe.

